  "sourceAssessment": [
    "Exact fine-face-v1 gate changes station82 breadth from .65 to .78. The old tangent at108 is explicitly supplied to both adjacent cubics, localizing the change above108 while preserving attached eye/lid/lower-face surfaces. Station82 shares its derivative across the rounded pole and cubic segments.",
    "naturalSurface is set on every draw from the exact same fine recipe gate. It enlarges iris pigment coverage and tones sclera without changing the aperture or globe/lid geometry; subtle warmth changes pigment only. No new normal-noise or saved trait sampling is introduced.",
    "Older non-fine mesh and shader paths remain exact. Tests intentionally pin the old crown for historical full-geometry comparisons; new current-modern clean-versus-groomed isolation and eye/lid comparisons retain coverage for the new crown. Original golden hashes are unchanged.",
    "Legacy gallery controls are explicitly non-fine, while modern clean/groomed rows remain present. This is appropriate compatibility separation, not proof that modern face pixels remain unchanged."
  ],
